        "type": "composition",
        "event": "Earlier history: the STF was founded in 1890–91 (15 ministers), cut to 11 by Vargas (1931), expanded 11→16 by the military regime's AI-2 (1965) and purged of three ministers under AI-5 (1969, back to 11). The 1988 democratic Constitution kept the 11-seat court (retirement at 70).",
